        <mxCell id="BZfb45Ejs4DusSI1o8lm-132" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Comments&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;for my masters, i would like to implement a large system for tracking all OPG operations on web, i would like to implement it using nextjs, mongodb and typescript&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;this is a first step, a proposal to the mentor represented via a system ER diagram&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;core OPG manufacture feature lies between entitie PLANTING_ROW and HARVEST_ROW. from there are retreived all the other attributes of the system. other part is made of orders, admin actions, etc..&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;all attributes need further considerations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;methods need to be defined&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;after implementing core system, we can think about doing the financial reports feature&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-160" y="50" width="520" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
